#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/utility/vectorscope_advanced.rst:47
msgid ""
"This effect/filter draws and overlays a vectorscope of the video data. "
"Compared to the :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/utility/"
"vectorscope` effect it offers parameters to control the display mode and a "
"few other things."
msgstr ""
"Tento efekt/filter kreslí a prekrýva vektoroskop video dát. V porovnaní s "
"efektom :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/utility/vectorscope` ponúka "
"parametre na ovládanie režimu zobrazenia a niekoľko ďalších vecí."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/utility/vectorscope_advanced.rst:49
msgid ""
"This is different from the :ref:`view-vectorscope` from the :ref:`view_menu` "
"because the *Effect* version writes the vectorscope into the output video, "
"whereas the *View Menu* version displays the vectorscope in a separate "
"widget while you still can preview your project."
msgstr ""
"Toto sa líši od :ref:`view-vectorscope` z :ref:`view_menu` pretože verzia "
"*Efekt* zapisuje vektoroskop do výstupného videa, zatiaľ čo verzia *Menu "
"Zobraziť* zobrazuje vektoroskop v samostatnom widgete, kým stále môžete "
"zobraziť náhľad vášho projektu."

