#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/utility/vectorscope_advanced.rst:68
msgid ""
"Set color tint for gray/tint vectorscope mode. By default both options are "
"zero. This means no tint, and output will remain gray."
msgstr ""
"Nastavenie farebného tónu pre sivý/tónový režim vektoroskopu. Predvolene sú "
"obe možnosti nulové. To znamená žiadny tón a výstup zostane sivý."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/utility/vectorscope_advanced.rst:69
msgid "X / Y"
msgstr "x<sup>1/y</sup>"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/utility/vectorscope_advanced.rst:70
msgid "Integer"
msgstr "Celé číslo"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/utility/vectorscope_advanced.rst:71
msgid "Set which color component will be represented on X / Y axis"
msgstr "Nastavenie farebnej zložky, ktorá bude reprezentovaná na osi X / Y"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/utility/vectorscope_advanced.rst:72
msgid "Intensity"
msgstr "Intenzita"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/utility/vectorscope_advanced.rst:74
msgid ""
"Set intensity used by modes **gray**, **color**, **color3** and **color5** "
"for increasing brightness of color component which represents frequency of "
"(X, Y) location in graph"
msgstr ""
"Nastavenie intenzity používanej režimami **gray**, **color**, **color3** a "
"**color5** na zvýšenie jasu farebnej zložky, ktorá reprezentuje frekvenciu "
"polohy (X, Y) v grafe"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/utility/vectorscope_advanced.rst:75
msgid "Envelope"
msgstr "Obálka"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/utility/vectorscope_advanced.rst:77
msgid ""
"Set whether the scope draws an edge or not and how the edge behaves. See "
"below for available options."
msgstr ""
"Nastavenie, či rozsah kreslí hranu alebo nie a ako sa hrana správa. Dostupné "
"možnosti nájdete nižšie."

